@startuml
title Fork 自动运行评论 Git OAuth L2 种下
' 测试用户角色: 租户用户
' T1 同用户源 L2 种下 / T2 他人不种 / T3 非 Fork 不种 / T7 snapshot 补种

actor "操作者" as U
participant "taskFE Fork" as FE
participant "taskTaskService" as T
database "task_comments" as C
participant "taskCredentialService" as Cred

U -> FE: 确认自动运行并派生
FE -> T: POST todos auto_run + repo_identities\n(仅 git_identity_id)
T -> T: prepareAutoRunRepoIdentities\nticket → 项目 L2 → 源评论 L2
T -> C: INSERT 【自动运行】含 oauth_gitsite
note right of T
  COMMENT_GIT_OAUTH_GRANTED
  via=fork_source_comment_l2_seed
end note
Cred -> T: GET container-snapshot?comment_id=
T -> C: 若缺 L2 则同路径补种 UPDATE
T --> Cred: identities 含 oauth_gitsite
Cred --> U: 换票成功 / 不再 BINDING_MISSING
@enduml
